   "body": "A test-only fix is on [the fork branch](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/1971-rate-limit-test-clock), commit [0fd2192a4](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/commit/0fd2192a49a7ca76c466eaca3b3166b8463520de), based on `ed0ab567`.\n\nThe test directly checks the existing `passing` decision for `Retry-After: 3600`, exhausted usage and no balance, and retains the real gateway response/status and one-upstream-attempt checks. Short rate-limit cases still exercise successful retries. The one-second budget on the whole request is removed; production retry behavior is unchanged.\n\nAn evidence-only overlay injecting 1.1 seconds of unrelated delay fails the original assertion and passes the changed test. Separate production overlays that incorrectly retry the long limit or usage/balance refusals fail the changed test. No delay is shipped in the test. This is controlled evidence, not a reproduction of the reporter's loaded Mac.\n\nParent related gateway tests passed under `-race`; gateway vet and the full offline `nogui` build also passed. Full repository suite and cross-platform runs were not performed. AI-assisted implementation and review.",
